        <h2>Calculating distance</h2>
        <p>
            As distance is equal to the length of the path, it can be difficult to calculate the exact length of path. In some cases, calculus can be used to calculate the length. Let us assume that the path is specified nicely in the form {`\\(\y = f(x)\\)`}.
